  "summary": [
    "Lists eight SKILLs (embed-dlid, index-docs, query-docs, resolve-dlid, four check SKILLs) with write permissions and requirement mapping.",
    "Defines two Agents: toc-updater generates document info for up to 3 documents, and query-worker selects relevant documents read-only.",
    "Describes responsibilities of operation and lookup SKILLs: ID embedding, ToC build, search, and DLID resolution.",
    "Describes check SKILLs that only detect: missing or duplicate IDs, broken links, stale ToC, and change-impact candidates.",
    "Gives a use-case diagram of users, the project-management AI and calling skills against the SKILLs.",
    "Gives sequence diagrams per SKILL, with scripts holding the logic and SKILL.md only delegating.",
    "Defines the operational flow: check-dlid, embed-dlid, check-links, index-docs, then check-impact, restarting after body edits.",
    "Specifies how check-impact reports changed documents with direct referrers and how hashes in link titles are rewritten.",
    "Specifies Agent data exchange: identifiers, request and result contents, error values, script validation and deletion timing."
  ],
